  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Pinkie Flamingo Welcomes You To Winner Winner! Chicken Dinner!<br>​​​​​​​3Kings/6Twins/QueenSleeper/FullSleeper/4Baths<br><br>You've hit the vacation jackpot with this sure winner! Vacation beach house sleeps 16 in Seacrest style. It's your lucky day as you have found the perfect spot for your next vacation. Recently remodeled and ideally located near all of the 30A action, Winner Winner! Chicken Dinner! Is just waiting on your party's arrival. With 3 King Suites, 6 Bunks, plus 2 pull-out sleeper sofas, your group of 16 will find plenty of space in which to luxuriate. Adorned with several outdoor porches plus a third-floor top shelf entertainment space complete with 50” TV, you will enjoy discovering all of the vignettes this home has to offer for large and small group gatherings.<br><br>But let's do a little walk though…just to make sure! Coastal colors and classic furnishings greet you as you enter the main first floor living area. Open and spacious with upholstered seating and a friendly chalk-painted dining table seating 8 plus 4 bar stools nearby, the first floor also opens out onto a lovely and serene screened porch with additional seating for 4 more. You will find the well-appointed kitchen to be fully stocked with all the cookware, bakeware and small appliances you will need for any gastronomical creation you dream up. Also located on the main level is one of the 3 King bedrooms, perfect for that someone who does not want to do stairs.<br><br>Up we go to the second floor to find 2 more King suites with private decks plus a common sitting area with a full-size pull-out sleeper sofa. But don't stop here…the walk up to the third floor is soooo worth it! Here you will find lots of surprises including a bunk room with 2 bunks sets with trundles, accommodating 6 in all. Two more sleep spots are nearby in a common sitting area featuring a Queen-size sleeper sofa. It's the perfect entertainment zone with its own mini-fridge and wet bar. Open the doors to discover yet another outdoor gathering spot for catching a lofty breeze and the panoramic rooftop views.<br><br>With three levels, 5 outdoor sitting areas/porches, 8 TVs, DVD player downstairs, outdoor gas grill, outdoor shower, this beach house is great for multiple families. Situated just minutes from the heart of Rosemary Beach and Peddlers Pavilion in Seacrest, visitors will enjoy access to the wonderful Seacrest amenities while here. Including Seacrest Lagoon, the largest private community pool on 30A sporting 378,000 gallons of refreshing water in a 12,000 square feet area complete with lounge chairs, umbrellas, and covered eating areas. This fabulous amenity is open year-round 9AM – 10PM for residents and vacation guests only. Walk to the town center where you will find bike rentals, cute dining spots, shopping, and live music seasonally. Gather under the stars at the outdoor, grass amphitheater and enjoy, concerts and movies.<br><br>But let's don't forget why you really came here! Beach access is easy and an adventure in and of itself. Golf cart shuttle service is offered from your driveway to the beach or you can opt for a 12-minute leisurely walk across Hwy 30-A, through the Sunset community using the pedestrian boardwalk. Additionally, from March through October, the Seacrest Tram Service provides a fun-filled ride to and from numerous designated tram stops to the beach or the Lagoon. Walk to the nearest tram stop and then call for pickup. The tram should magically appear in about fifteen minutes. Tram service runs every day starting at 9:00 AM with the last pickup from the beach at 5:30 PM.<br><br>Don't hedge your bet...go with a sure winner! <br><br>Makin' My Way Along 30A...Seacrest Beach<br><br>All of Pinkie's Properties Have A Few Things In Common<br>•\tMust Be 25 To Book<br>•\tNo Smoking <br>•\tCancellation OK 30 Days Prior To Check-In<br>•\tSheets & Bath Towels Included…BYO Beach Towels<br>•\tAll Kitchens Fully-Equipped With Cooking/Eating Utensils… BYO Spices & Food<br>•\tBasic Essentials Starter Set Only…TP, Paper Towels, Trash Bags, Soaps, Etc …Depending on Length of Stay You May Need More",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
